        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "Emoji-reaction guy here 🙋‍♂️\nYes you are! I love how quickly everything gets actioned! 🎉\n\n1. Would love to be able to pin the emoji reactions list, rather than it always being the \"last used\".\n\nI save time (and hopefully tokens) by just reacting to bot proposals. Basically 👍 👎 ⛔ 🆗 ✅ ⏲️ etc.\n\n2 . Would love for those reactions to show at the bottom of the bot message, not the top. The reason is, on long messages, the reaction gets lost above the fold.\n\n3. Custom emojis! j/k\nAre we no longer able to edit Routines and Instructions on the MacOS app? Still possible on mobile. I have to ask the bot for any changes."
        },
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
