        "text": "@poteto Emoji-reaction guy here 🙋‍♂️\nYes you are! I love how quickly everything gets actioned! 🎉\n\n1. Would love to be able to pin the emoji reactions list, rather than it always being the \"last used\".\n\nI save time (and hopefully tokens) by just reacting to bot proposals. Basically 👍 👎"
